+    "3CNF clauses.  Invertibility follows because the homogeneous recurrence "
+    "has period three and n is not divisible by three.  Repeated copies of each "
+    "parity block are sampled independently of the answer and create structural "
+    "diversity without changing the solution.  Generation evaluates the sampled "
+    "assignment; it never runs SAT search or elimination.  The attack panel "
+    "checks incidence outliers, all-zero and bit-flip greed, random restarts, "
+    "and the tempting but wrong public-label recurrence.  Gaussian elimination "
+    "is disclosed separately as the successful Track-B reference algorithm."
+)
