+        "  T_i-F_i, y_i-T_i, y_i-z_i, y_i-l_i, z_i-F_i, z_i-s_i, T_i-a_i, F_i-b_i,",
+        "  a_i-b_i, l_i-m_i, r_i-s_i, l_i-a_i, m_i-b_i, a_i-r_i, b_i-s_i.",
