+        "For each resulting clause q make eight new vertices L_q,M_q,N_q,R_q,U_q,V_q,D_q,C_q and the ten internal edges",
+        "  L_q-M_q, M_q-N_q, N_q-R_q, L_q-U_q, U_q-N_q, M_q-V_q, V_q-R_q, L_q-D_q, D_q-C_q, C_q-R_q.",
