+    "hardness_basis": (
+        "Track B: after the paper's Section 3 reduction is decoded, Gaussian "
+        "elimination over GF(2) solves the n parity equations in O(n^3) scalar "
+        "operations; selftest records its measured shipping-preset wall time "
+        "and operation count, while a bit-parallel cyclic-prefix inversion uses "
+        "at most 96 exact word operations at shipping n=383."
+    ),
