+    "lossless notation, not a seed or hash.  Generation evaluates the sampled "
+    "assignment; it never runs SAT search or elimination.  The attack panel "
+    "checks incidence outliers, all-zero and bit-flip greed, random restarts, "
+    "and the tempting but wrong public-label recurrence.  Gaussian elimination "
