   183	
   184	    A uniformly sampled assignment is evaluated on an invertible cyclic 3-XOR
   185	    system.  The resulting parity checks define a satisfiable 3CNF and hence,
   186	    by the paper's gadget construction, an ERR:IC of the threshold size.
